<title>USA: Piedmont Muni Power, S.C., $162 mln bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>Piedmont Muni Power, S.C., $162 mln bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said Wednesday it repriced Piedmont Municipal Power Agency's $161.7 million electric revenue bonds, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2013 unchanged at 5.65 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>RE: $161,745,000*</p>
<p>PIEDMONT MUNICIPAL POWER AGENCY</p>
<p>(SOUTH CAROLINA)</p>
<p>ELECTRIC REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996B REFUNDING SERIES</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
